Grid/DCA backtested headline `pnlRatio` (a fraction, 1.0 == 100%);
scaled ×100 into `annualized_return`. NaN/unparseable → 0 (native
`decimalOrZero`).

Flywheel backtested headline `refAnnualYieldPercentage` (a fraction);
scaled ×100 into `annualized_return`. Absent → `annualized_return` stays
`None` (native does NOT fall back to the floor APY).

Quote currency for the pair (region rename). Wire `tradeQuoteCcy`.
Always emitted. Manual = `instManager.getTradeQuoteCcy(...)`;
Easy = `payCoin`.
